X:1
T:Look, Ye Saints, The Sight Is Glorious
T:BRYN CALFARIA
C:Music: William Owen, 1852 · Words: Thomas Kelly, 1809
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: Lutheran Book of Worship, 1978, Hymn 156. Later found to match the English Hymnal 1906. Setting bears some resemblance to "Caniadau y cyssegr a r teulu", 1878 #. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/bryn_calfaria_owen) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
